---
layout: layouts/page.njk
title: 문의
eyebrow: CONTACT
lead: 입학, 협력, 학과 활동에 관한 문의를 받습니다.
---
<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="contact-grid">
      <div class="contact-card">
        <h2 class="h3">학과 사무실</h2>
        <p>{{ site.contact.office_detail }}</p>
        {% if site.contact.dept_phone %}<p>전화 <a href="tel:{{ site.contact.dept_phone | replace('-', '') }}">{{ site.contact.dept_phone }}</a></p>{% endif %}
        {% if site.contact.dept_email %}<p>이메일 <a href="mailto:{{ site.contact.dept_email }}">{{ site.contact.dept_email }}</a></p>{% endif %}
      </div>
      <div class="contact-card">
        <h2 class="h3">대학원교학팀</h2>
        <p>입학·학사 문의</p>
        <p>전화 <a href="tel:{{ site.contact.grad_office_phone | replace('-', '') }}">{{ site.contact.grad_office_phone }}</a> · 팩스 {{ site.contact.grad_office_fax }}</p>
        <p><a href="{{ site.links.graduate }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">대학원 홈페이지<span class="sr-only">(새 창)</span></a></p>
      </div>
      {%- set park = collections.faculty | findBySlug("park-yangsoo") %}
      {%- if park %}
      <div class="contact-card">
        <h2 class="h3">교수 연구실({{ park.data.name }})</h2>
        <p>{{ park.data.office }} · 협력·학과 활동 문의</p>
        <p>전화 <a href="tel:{{ park.data.phone | replace('-', '') }}">{{ park.data.phone }}</a></p>
        <p>이메일 <a href="mailto:{{ park.data.email }}">{{ park.data.email }}</a></p>
      </div>
      {%- endif %}
    </div>
    <h2 class="group-title">찾아오시는 길</h2>
    <dl class="info-table">
      <div><dt>주소</dt><dd>{{ site.contact.address }} {{ site.contact.office }}</dd></div>
    </dl>
    <p class="note">{{ admission.notice }}</p>
  </div>
</section>
